{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Trade and shipping Holland-Russia 1590-1780"},{"typeName":"alternativeTitle","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Handel en scheepvaart op Rusland 1590-1780"]},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NHDA D0075"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NHDA: R0124"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NHDA: R0125"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NHDA: R0126"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NHDA: R0127"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:40186"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"drs. P. de Buck"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Data Station Admin"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Collectie van data met betrekking tot de handel van Nederland met Rusland in de periode 1590-1780. Het betreft de scheepvaart van Nederlanders naar Noord-Rusland (Archangel) en Sint-Petersburg. De route naar Archangel was één van de grote handelsroutes van de Nederlandse Republiek vanaf het einde van de zestiende eeuw tot in de achttiende eeuw.<br>De oorspronkelijke gedachte van de in 1999 overledene historicus dhr. P. de Buck was de data in vier delen te deponeren volgens de afzonderlijke thema's zoals ze bij het NHDA reeds geregistreerd stonden:<br>- Galjootsgeldregisters, 1722-1780 (NHDA: R0124)<br>- Scheepsmaten in de 17de en 18de eeuw (NHDA: R0125)<br>- Sontvaart in de Oostzee, ca. 1600-1721 (NHDA: R0126)<br>- Amsterdamse vaart op Noord-Rusland, 1590-1725 (NHDA: R0127)<br>Dat idee is niet meer gerealiseerd wegens gebrek aan volledige documentatie en richtlijnen van de data collector zelf. In deze dataset staan alle bestanden door elkaar, vrij om bestudeerd te worden.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Trade"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Economic history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Shipping"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ship measurements"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Voyages"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1970-01-01"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-04-27"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1970-01-01"},{"typeNam